'' The four things that made up 71% of the corpus's unresolved references, and each
'' one is declared by something OTHER than a 'dim': fbc predeclares TRUE, FALSE and
'' __FUNCTION__ in the global scope (fbc calls 'dim as integer true' a DUPLICATED
'' DEFINITION, so they are symbols and not keywords); 'this' is the implicit receiver
'' of a member definition, never written as a parameter; and a FOR counter with an
'' 'as' clause is a declaration rather than a use.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --resolve tests/symbols/src/predeclared.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 unresolved
'' EXPECT-NOT: unresolved:
